- [Agent tooling](https://rickylabs.github.io/netscript/ai/agent-tooling/): The rest of this pillar is about the AI you build into your app — the engine, the MCP client stack, durable chat. This page is the mirror image: what NetScript gives the coding agents (and the humans…
- [Chat UI](https://rickylabs.github.io/netscript/ai/chat-ui/): The AI chat interface ships as a copy-registry collection in @netscript/fresh-ui: a composer, a message thread, tool-call cards, a model picker, and a generative-UI block renderer. alpha
- [Durable chat](https://rickylabs.github.io/netscript/ai/durable-chat/): @netscript/fresh/ai is the server + island seam that turns a Fresh route into a durable AI chat: a chat whose message history and in-flight tool calls survive reload, reconnect, and multi-tab replay…
- [AI engine](https://rickylabs.github.io/netscript/ai/engine/): This is the engine guide — how the pieces of @netscript/ai fit together and when to reach for each one. @netscript/ai is the provider-agnostic AI engine at the design center of the stack: a…
